---
import config from '../data/config.json';
import '../styles/components/legal-modals.css';
---

<!-- Native HTML5 Dialog Portals for Compliance & Legal Documentation -->

<!-- 1. Terms & Conditions Modal -->
<dialog id="dialog-terms" class="legal-dialog" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <div class="dialog-head">
      <h2 id="terms-title">Terms &amp; Conditions of Research Services</h2>
      <button class="dialog-close-btn" type="button" aria-label="Close Terms and Conditions dialog">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <h3>1. General Agreement</h3>
      <p>
        By accessing or subscribing to the equity research publications provided by <strong>{config.brandName}</strong> ({config.analystName}, SEBI Reg. No. <strong>{config.sebiRegNo}</strong>), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions in full.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Scope of Services</h3>
      <p>
        {config.brandName} provides non-discretionary equity research reports and analytical opinions under SEBI (Research Analysts) Regulations, 2014. We do not provide Portfolio Management Services (PMS), discretionary asset management, or assured-return schemes.
      </p>

      <h3>3. No Guaranteed Returns</h3>
      <p>
        Investing in securities involves significant risk of loss. Past performance, backtests, or historical case studies do not guarantee future returns. The subscriber bears sole financial responsibility for their trade execution and capital allocation.
      </p>

      <h3>4. Non-Transferability &amp; Copyright</h3>
      <p>
        All research publications, models, and communications sent to subscribers are strictly confidential and protected by intellectual property laws. Redistribution or forwarding of content without explicit written consent is strictly prohibited and subject to legal prosecution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<!-- 2. Privacy Policy Modal -->
<dialog id="dialog-privacy" class="legal-dialog" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <div class="dialog-head">
      <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy &amp; Data Protection Policy</h2>
      <button class="dialog-close-btn" type="button" aria-label="Close Privacy Policy dialog">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <h3>1. Information Collected</h3>
      <p>
        We collect personal data required for regulatory onboarding and statutory compliance under SEBI guidelines, including name, PAN (where required), contact phone, email address, and billing address.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Use of Information</h3>
      <p>
        Your data is used solely to deliver subscription research notes, issue GST tax invoices, and comply with SEBI record-keeping requirements. We strictly do not sell, lease, or monetize client personal data to third parties.
      </p>

      <h3>3. Data Security</h3>
      <p>
        We enforce administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to prevent unauthorized access or disclosure of your information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<!-- 3. Statutory SEBI Disclosures Modal -->
<dialog id="dialog-disclosures" class="legal-dialog" aria-labelledby="disclosures-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <div class="dialog-head">
      <h2 id="disclosures-title">Statutory SEBI Disclosures &amp; Conflict of Interest</h2>
      <button class="dialog-close-btn" type="button" aria-label="Close Disclosures dialog">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <h3>1. Regulatory Registration</h3>
      <p>
        {config.analystName} is registered with the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) as an Individual Research Analyst under Registration Number <strong>{config.sebiRegNo}</strong> and enlisted with BSE under Enlistment Number <strong>{config.bseEnlistmentNo}</strong>.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Conflict of Interest Disclosures (SEBI RA Regulations Clause 19)</h3>
      <p>
        In accordance with SEBI guidelines, {config.brandName} and its associates declare that:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Neither the analyst nor associates hold financial interest exceeding 1% in covered securities at the time of publication, unless specifically disclosed in the research note.</li>
        <li>We have not received any compensation from the subject company for investment banking, merchant banking, or brokerage services in the past 12 months.</li>
        <li>We have not served as an officer, director, or employee of the subject company.</li>
        <li>We have not engaged in market-making activities for the subject securities.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<!-- 4. Refund & Cancellation Policy Modal -->
<dialog id="dialog-refund" class="legal-dialog" aria-labelledby="refund-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <div class="dialog-head">
      <h2 id="refund-title">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h2>
      <button class="dialog-close-btn" type="button" aria-label="Close Refund Policy dialog">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="dialog-body">
      <h3>1. Non-Refundable Subscription Fees</h3>
      <p>
        Fees paid for subscription to independent equity research publications are non-refundable once onboarding access is activated and proprietary research materials or channels have been made available.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Exceptions Mandated by Law</h3>
      <p>
        Refunds are processed only if our SEBI registration is suspended, revoked, or canceled by SEBI, or if duplicate payment transactions occur due to technical gateway errors.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

